ion of  the actor wiggle around inside a vending  machine  ashley reese joked on twitter matthew  mchibby  looking all flat deeply upset me  meanwhile frozen actor josh  gad suggested a lucrative idea 3d dorito  matthew mcconaughey needs to do a  crossover with lincoln matthew  mcconaughey that of course references  the numerous ads mcconaughey has done  for ford's luxury automobile division  lincoln for what it's worth  mcconaughey's appearances in those  commercials have reportedly driven up  sales over the years so celebrity  endorsement really does work  take a long way  after the doritos commercial aired  lincoln even took a moment to get in on  the joke tweeting a photo of doritos  crumbs in a lincoln with the caption  doritos guess we should have seen this  coming huh comedian jared breed was much  more blunt about how mcconaughey's  dorito commercial made him feel  writing on twitter paper matthew  mcconaughey will haunt my dreams for the  rest of time  elsewhere comedian frank caliendo  hilariously wondered how much weight did  matthew mcconaughey lose for that  commercial  others in the twitter sphere said things  like the matthew mcconaughey flat  stanley doritos commercial was the thing  of nightmares and my life is worse for  having witnessed it and that matthew  mcconaughey doritos advert is going to  haunt my nightmares  um okay what's that mean means i'm bad  at parties  on the flip side some thought the  commercial wasn't creepy at all and only  found the humor in it one twitter user  took some time out of their day to write  so far the matthew mcconaughey doritos  commercial is in the lead for best ad  another viewer argued the 3d doritos  commercial with matthew mcconaughey was  the best one of the night  hashtag flat matthew award-winning  reporter laura geller admitted that she  found the ad pretty funny but also  confessed she might be biased because  she has quote a minor crush on matthew  mcconaughey hey  who doesn't  yeah however it was bach